From 96e74a6a35e9d23ec0041333e5358829cc8c2575 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexanderNyr <131390634+AlexanderNyr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 09:00:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] W1 update: HTML tokeniser

WEBVIEW_PLAN.md phase W1:
- wv_html.{h,c}: 18-state iterative tokeniser, no recursion,
  arena-bounded (tokens+attrs+string pool, truncated flag, scan drains
  to EOF on any cap)
- char refs: named five + numeric, in text and attribute values;
  NUL -> U+FFFD -> '?' (8-bit font ceiling); names lower-cased
- tolerance: < at EOF, <<>>, unclosed quotes/comments all produce
  usable tokens; EOF in any state emits what exists + WV_T_EOF
- host gate: test_wv_html.c, 122 checks: exact streams, malformed
  corpus, 10KB attr value, 100KB text, 10k tags, 3000 fuzz iters +
  64KiB blob, arena walked and verified
- in-guest smoke in /apps/webview (9 tokens, PASS); test_webview.sh
  asserts it
- bugs found by tests: double advance after char refs; attrs not
  flushed after quoted value (class=... lost) -- fixed + regressions
